Changes in this fork (MyWork Kit):
- package renamed to dsh-mywork-codex-ui; loader row ids prefixed `mywork-`
- sidebar navigation tidied (src/client/settings-sections.ts): the "扩展管理"
  group holds Scheduled tasks and Plugin market; Plugin configuration and
  Connectors are reached from Settings instead. Experts / Skills / IM assistant
  are shown only when a settings section with that label is actually
  registered; nothing routes to the "Codex UI" about page any more
- 定时任务 / IM助理 / MCP 连接器 are standalone main panels (src/client/section-panels.tsx,
  ids `mywork-schedule` / `mywork-im` / `mywork-mcp`) instead of settings sections: the
  first two host the settings.section entries of @michengai/dsh-automation and
  @michengai/dsh-im-connect, the third is this package's native connector list plus a
  new-tab link to the dsh-mcp-connector market page
- no iframes: the "Usage statistics" page (which framed a third-party billing
  plugin) and the framed MCP connector market are removed; the Connectors page
  always shows the native list and offers to open the market in a new tab
- release / CI tooling, the usage-frame build step and test-only
  devDependencies removed; upstream README kept as README.upstream.md
